# cursor — шаги записи (что показывается — cursor.md)
# Каретку двигает `Jump down` / `Jump right`: подсветка идёт за кареткой.
title Text cursor | A cursor you can see, and a circle where it lands
open Cursor.md
# Родная каретка: GIF про саму каретку и её настройки.
rec-caret off
caret ## Monday
say Default: Jump down → the thin cursor is easy to lose
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

say Color the text cursor → red
settings Visual
set Color the text cursor = on
set Cursor color = #e03131
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → the cursor is red
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

say Shape the text cursor → 6 px
settings Visual
set Shape the text cursor = on
set Cursor width = 6
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → a thick cursor
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

say Highlight where you land → on
settings Visual
set Highlight where you land = on
set Highlight size = 40
set How long it lasts = 1200
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → a circle marks where it lands
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

say Use inside current line → on
settings Visual
set Use inside current line = on
caret - [ ] #todo #low || Buy groceries || 📅2026-10-07 @ Buy groceries
say Jump right → the circle inside the line too
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
expect ## Monday
